    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>A modern, accessable, fully customizable &amp; user friendly YouTube Video Player for wordrpess. You can play any YouTube video in wordpress Post, Page, widget area, Other Custom Post Type and Theme template file using This plugin.</p>\n<h3>Demo</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://yt-player.bplugins.com/\" title=\"See Demo\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Click Here To see demo</a></p>\n<h4>How to Use ?</h4>\n<p>Watch the video below to learn how to use YT Player Plugin.</p>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"How to Use YT Player Plugin  | Play a YouTube video in WordPress\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/NGvVtSXcZK4?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\n<h4>ShortCode</h4>\n<p>To Embed Any YouTube Video Use the ShortCode Below..</p>\n<pre>[ytp]YouTube Video URL[/ytp] </pre>\n<ul>\n<li>Video URL must be formatted like that: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NGvVtSXcZK4</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Features</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Play any Youtube video by using the video ID</li>\n<li>No need to use embed code. </li>\n<li>Responsive &#8211; works with any screen size.</li>\n<li>Fullscreen &#8211; supports native fullscreen with fallback to &#8220;full window&#8221; modes</li>\n<li>Lite weight and super fast performance. </li>\n<li>ShortCode driven- Add the video player to any post/page or widget using shortcode </li>\n<li>Control over every button of the player.</li>\n<li>Powered by html5 </li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Feedback</h4>\n<p>Liked that plugin? Hate it? Want a new feature?  [Send me some feedback](mailto: support@bplugins.com &#8220;Send feedback&#8221;)</p>\n",
        "installation": "<p>This section describes how to install the plugin and get it working.</p>\n<p>E.g</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Upload <code>plugin-directory</code> to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress</li>\n<li>Use shortcode in page, post or in widgets.</li>\n<li>If you want video in your theme php file, Place <code>&lt;?php echo do_shortcode('YOUR_SHORTCODE'); ?&gt;</code> in your templates</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='how%20do%20i%20install%20this%20plugin%3F'>\nHow do I install this plugin?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>You can install as others regular wordpress plugin. No different way. Please see on installation tab.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='what%20video%20type%20can%20i%20play%3F'>\nWhat Video type can i play?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>You can play any YouTube video.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='how%20many%20player%20i%20can%20publish%20in%20my%20site%3F'>\nHow many player i can publish in my site?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>You can publish unlimited video with YT player Plugin</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.6.2 &#8211; 28 Jan, 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Feature: Set Ratio</li>\n<li>Update: Freemius WordPress SDK</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.6.1 &#8211; 2 July 2024</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated: Player library</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.6.0 &#8211; 2 Jan 2024</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added: &#8216;Video Player for youtube&#8217; Block in free version</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>v1.5.6 (Aug 28, 2023)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added 2 Gutenberg Block in Premium version (video, Timeline)</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.5.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Improved Code Quality</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Bug Fix &#8211; iOs:Full screen video cut</li>\n<li>Improved Performance.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added Quick ShortCode [ytp]YouTube Video URL[/ytp] for Post/page/widget/Guten Block. </li>\n<li>Fix Minor Bug</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Review request as Admin notice removed.</li>\n<li>Imporved performance </li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial Release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "A modern, accessible, fully customizable &amp; user-friendly YouTube Video Player for WordPress.",
    "description": "<p>A modern, accessable, fully customizable &amp; user friendly YouTube Video Player for wordrpess. You can play any YouTube video in wordpress Post, Page, widget area, Other Custom Post Type and Theme template file using This plugin.</p>\n<h3>Demo</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://yt-player.bplugins.com/\" title=\"See Demo\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Click Here To see demo</a></p>\n<h4>How to Use ?</h4>\n<p>Watch the video below to learn how to use YT Player Plugin.</p>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"How to Use YT Player Plugin  | Play a YouTube video in WordPress\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/NGvVtSXcZK4?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\n<h4>ShortCode</h4>\n<p>To Embed Any YouTube Video Use the ShortCode Below..</p>\n<pre>[ytp]YouTube Video URL[/ytp] </pre>\n<ul>\n<li>Video URL must be formatted like that: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NGvVtSXcZK4</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Features</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Play any Youtube video by using the video ID</li>\n<li>No need to use embed code. </li>\n<li>Responsive &#8211; works with any screen size.</li>\n<li>Fullscreen &#8211; supports native fullscreen with fallback to &#8220;full window&#8221; modes</li>\n<li>Lite weight and super fast performance. </li>\n<li>ShortCode driven- Add the video player to any post/page or widget using shortcode </li>\n<li>Control over every button of the player.</li>\n<li>Powered by html5 </li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Feedback</h4>\n<p>Liked that plugin? Hate it? Want a new feature?  [Send me some feedback](mailto: support@bplugins.com &#8220;Send feedback&#8221;)</p>\n",
